rols for HDDAGI filters. The existing boolean filters (probes/ambient/reflections) only allow on/off toggling, making transitions harsh. This PR adds float sliders (0.0–1.0) for each filter, enabling smooth blending.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAdds three new properties:\r\n- `dynamic_gi_filter_probes_intensity`\r\n- `dynamic_gi_filter_ambient_intensity`\r\n- `dynamic_gi_filter_reflections_intensity`\r\n\r\nThese work alongside the existing boolean properties — they control the blend factor when the corresponding filter is enabled.\r\n\r\nBuilds on top of HDDAGI implementation from #119869.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-06-10T16:00:12Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T19:13:31Z","closed_at":"2026-06-10T18:57:32Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"David-Zuloyan:pr-119869","ref":"pr-119869","repo":{"id":1265244778,"node_id":"R_kgDOS2oaag","name":"godot","full_name":"David-Zuloyan/godot","owner":{